  "description": "The meme constructs a scene that juxtaposes the Power Rangers, a Black man, and a green-skinned ape-like figure to perpetuate a racist trope. The text sets up a false equivalence, implying that the Black Ranger's costume is being compared to the ape-like figure, thereby dehumanizing Black people. The Black man's confident posture and smile are used to falsely validate this racist comparison.",
